    "keys": "Settings \u2192 Account \u2192 API keys on the dashboard. Data key (Data API), Segmentation key (custom segments, cohort sync), Campaigns/Reports key (campaign search/stats/create/status, flows, business events, analytics), Inform key.",
    "dc": "dashboard-01 \u2194 api-01 (US), -02 EU, -03 India, -04 US, -05 SG, -06 ID, -101. Push API host is pushapi-{dc}.",
    "session": "Dashboard idle timeout 24h, hard limit 60 days; an internal ~2h JWT is used by the SPA. Cookie transport is therefore best-effort; API keys are the stable path.",
    "how_to_capture": "Integration tab \u2192 Import HAR. Only structure is kept; secrets are dropped.",
    "dashboard_auth": "The dashboard SPA sends Authorization: Bearer <jwt> + RefreshToken + MoeTraceId + MOE-APPKEY and appends ?api=1; it refreshes via GET /session/refresh. Paste the request headers from DevTools (or cookies) in Settings; candidates come from the public app bundle and are verified read-only."
